OL,3,BReport: Median monthly salary in       
OL,4,BFinland is E3,700   but gender gap     
OL,5,Bremains wide                           
OL,6,GThe highest earners in Finland are     
OL,7,Gmiddle-aged men, and women in full-time
OL,8,Gemployment earn almost 500 euros less  
OL,9,Gthan their male counterparts.          
